  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d95f71226bf26bc4caed6a0458a3b538, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lesson 28 Question 5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: Why should all Christians study their Bibles?
  answers:
  - Only teachers need to study
  - To know God and love Him more
  - To impress their friends
  - To get to heaven
  correctAnswerIndex: 1
  discussionAnswer: Believers study their Bibles so that they can truly know God
    through Jesus Christ. When you know God for who He is, you will love, worship,
    and enjoy Him truly.
